{
  "_notes": [
    "Real TMDB titles for the Series Finale e2e cast. Resolved by resolveCatalogue() (exact title or original title, same first-air/release year); TV seasons hold aired episodes only, season 0 excluded.",
    "jeanne-dielman: the brief listed \"Jeanne Dielman, 23 quai du Commerce, 1080 Bruxelles\" (1975). TMDB (44012) titles it with a comma after \"23\" and dates its release 1976-01-21, so the lock uses TMDB's title and year. Same film, not a substitution.",
    "past-lives: TMDB has two exact \"Past Lives\" (2023) results; the resolver takes the one with the most votes (666277, the Celine Song feature).",
    "Additions beyond the brief's list: parasite, portrait, moonlight, lady-bird, roma, worst-person, banshees, decision-to-leave, godzilla-minus-one, florida-project, minari, nomadland. A user holds one status per title, and e2e_ava alone needs 38 distinct films (22 completed + 2 dropped + 4 planning in 2025, 8 in 2024, 2 in 2023) against the 29 listed. Minari and Nomadland carry TMDB's release year (2021), not their 2020 premieres."
  ],
